# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Fluidmos/Entities/devices.yml
ent-KsFluidPort = fluid port
    .desc = A pipe fitting with a small tank. Pour reagents in, or plumb them in, to feed them into the pipe as liquid; or switch it to draw the pipe's liquid out, for plumbing to take.
# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Fluidmos/Entities/devices.yml
ent-KsPhaseSeparator = phase separator
    .desc = Pumps gas and vapor out straight through and pushes liquid out from the side. Put a heater ahead of it and it is a still.
# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Fluidmos/Entities/devices.yml
ent-KsExpansionValve = expansion valve
    .desc = Lets liquid refrigerant through to the low side, where it flashes and chills. Can hold its outlet at a set pressure by itself.
